@startuml
actor "User" as User
participant "Frontend\n(React)" as UI
participant "FastAPI\n(REST Backend)" as API
participant "Redis\n(In-memory Cache)" as Cache
participant "PostgreSQL\n(Database)" as DB

User -> UI : Submits movie rating
activate UI

UI -> API : POST /api/ratings (JSON payload)
activate API

API -> Cache : Validate auth token
activate Cache
Cache --> API : Token valid (Returns User ID)
deactivate Cache

API -> API : Validate rating value (1-10)
activate API
deactivate API

API -> DB : INSERT rating (user_id, movie_id, value)
activate DB
DB --> API : Record confirmed
deactivate DB

API ->> Cache : [Async Task] Update movie cache
activate Cache
deactivate Cache

API --> UI : 201 Created (Success)
deactivate API

UI --> User : Update UI with new rating
deactivate UI
@enduml
